- I'm pretty frustrated because I think I could have won

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:25.880
if I hadn't just been affected by everybody else's

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:27.360
doubtfulness.

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:30.960
- I was reminded of the different perspectives of veganism.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.799
